@startuml SD_ProjectOverview
title Sequence Diagram Tong quan - Film Lab Ecosystem
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Nguoi dung" as User
boundary "Giao dien ung dung" as UI
control "Backend API" as API
database "Co so du lieu" as DB
participant "Dich vu AI" as AI

== Dang nhap ==

User -> UI: Nhap email va mat khau
UI -> API: Gui thong tin dang nhap
API -> DB: Tim tai khoan theo email trong users
DB --> API: Thong tin tai khoan

alt Thong tin hop le
  API -> API: Doi chieu mat khau voi password_hash
  API --> UI: Xac thuc thanh cong
  UI --> User: Hien thi cac module
else Thong tin khong hop le
  API --> UI: Tra loi loi xac thuc
  UI --> User: Hien thi thong bao loi
end

opt Nguoi dung da dang nhap
  User -> UI: Chon mot module
  UI -> API: Gui yeu cau chuc nang

  alt Film Lab
    API -> DB: Lay Film Lab, dich vu va goi
    DB --> API: Danh sach film_labs, lab_services, lab_packages
    API --> UI: Hien thi danh muc
    User -> UI: Chon dich vu/goi va xac nhan dat
    UI -> API: Gui thong tin don hang
    API -> DB: Kiem tra Film Lab va cac muc da chon
    DB --> API: Ket qua kiem tra
    alt Du lieu hop le
      API -> DB: Tao orders
      API -> DB: Tao order_items
      DB --> API: order_id
      opt Ghi nhan giao dich
        API -> DB: Tao transactions gan voi order_id
        DB --> API: transaction_id
      end
      API --> UI: Tra thong tin don hang
      UI --> User: Hien thi xac nhan
    else Du lieu khong hop le
      API --> UI: Tra loi loi tao don
      UI --> User: Hien thi thong bao loi
    end

  else Marketplace
    API -> DB: Lay danh sach products
    DB --> API: Danh sach san pham
    API --> UI: Hien thi san pham
    alt Luu san pham yeu thich
      User -> UI: Chon yeu thich
      UI -> API: Gui user_id va product_id
      API -> DB: Tao favorites
      DB --> API: Xac nhan
      API --> UI: Cap nhat trang thai yeu thich
    else Dat mua san pham
      User -> UI: Chon san pham va so luong
      UI -> API: Gui yeu cau dat mua
      API -> DB: Kiem tra products.stock
      DB --> API: Ket qua kiem tra ton kho
      alt Con du hang
        API -> DB: Tao marketplace_orders
        DB --> API: order_id
        opt Tai minh chung thanh toan
          User -> UI: Chon tep minh chung
          UI -> API: Tai tep len
          API -> DB: Tao uploads
          DB --> API: upload_id
          API -> DB: Gan upload_id vao proof_upload_id
          DB --> API: Xac nhan cap nhat
        end
        API --> UI: Tra thong tin don hang
        UI --> User: Hien thi ket qua
      else Khong du hang
        API --> UI: Tra loi loi ton kho
        UI --> User: Yeu cau dieu chinh so luong
      end
    end

  else Cong dong va su kien
    alt Dang bai hoac binh luan
      User -> UI: Nhap bai viet hoac binh luan
      UI -> API: Gui noi dung
      alt Tao bai viet
        API -> DB: Tao posts
        DB --> API: post_id
      else Tao binh luan
        API -> DB: Tao comments
        DB --> API: comment_id
      end
      API --> UI: Tra noi dung vua tao
      UI --> User: Hien thi noi dung
    else Gui tin nhan
      User -> UI: Nhap nguoi nhan va noi dung
      UI -> API: Gui sender_id, recipient_id, content
      API -> DB: Tao messages
      DB --> API: Xac nhan gui tin
      API --> UI: Tra ket qua
      UI --> User: Hien thi tin nhan
    else Dang ky su kien
      User -> UI: Chon workshop hoac photowalk
      UI -> API: Gui event_type va event_id
      API -> DB: Tao event_registrations
      DB --> API: Xac nhan dang ky
      API --> UI: Tra ket qua
      UI --> User: Hien thi xac nhan
    end

  else AI va anh
    alt Phan tich anh
      User -> UI: Chon anh can phan tich
      UI -> API: Tai anh len
      API -> DB: Tao uploads
      DB --> API: upload_id va url
      API -> AI: Gui anh de phan tich
      AI --> API: Tra ket qua phan tich
      API -> DB: Cap nhat uploads.quality
      DB --> API: Xac nhan cap nhat
      API --> UI: Tra ket qua phan tich
      UI --> User: Hien thi ket qua
    else Hoi dap theo tai lieu RAG
      User -> UI: Nhap cau hoi
      UI -> API: Gui cau hoi
      API -> DB: Tim tai lieu trong rag_documents
      DB --> API: Tra tai lieu lien quan
      API -> AI: Gui cau hoi kem ngu canh
      AI --> API: Tra cau tra loi
      API --> UI: Tra ket qua
      UI --> User: Hien thi cau tra loi
    end
  end
end

note over API, DB
  Luong minh hoa theo cac bang trong ERD.
  AI va giao dien la thanh phan tich hop, khong phai bang du lieu.
  event_id va order_items.item_id la lien ket da hinh.
end note

@enduml